    {
      "text": "Diamond soil is formed from the feces of the diamond bear. It is filled with rich nutrients and is one of the soils that can be sold for a high price in treasure yellow heaven. Hundreds of kilograms taken from a diamond bear’s cave are worth at least thirty immortal essence stones.",
