      "section": "bear-cave-soil",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among soils Gu Immortals seek for developing immortal apertures, diamond soil can grow minerals. Fertility of soil plays a huge role in the resources those apertures produce for cultivation.",
